<div class="eco-feature-section">
<div class="container">
<div class="row align-items-center justify-content-between feature-section-3">
<div class="col-md-6">
<img class="porto-lazyload" loading="lazy" data-src="/media.pakfactory.com/media_upload/coding_guide/certified-green-packaging2.webp"  alt="reduce carbon footprint" >
</div>
<div class="col-lg-5 col-md-6">
<div class="landing-page-section-des">
	<div class="upline">GREEN CERTIFIED PACKAGING</div>
	<h3>Showcase your green movement with certified packaging</h3>
	<p>Ensure your packaging meets your sustainable goals with certified packaging that provide environmental and social benefits.
</p>
