					<div class="name-cus"><span>Shannon Brown</span>Pipit & Finch</div> 

					</div>  
				   </div>
            </div>
	    <div class="item flex">
              	<div class="review-item">
				<p>The value that PackOasis has added to our brand is immeasurable. By making such high quality packaging, we are able to provide our customers with a top shelf experience.</p>
				<img class="porto-lazyload" loading="lazy" data-src="/media.pakfactory.com/media_upload/coding_guide/star-5.svg"  alt="5 star" >
				 <div class="customer-info">
